    "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Follow us on social media for more updates:</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><a title=\"Go to Stryker Facebook home page\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/StrykerAcuteCareforNurses\" target=\"_blank\">Facebook</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><a title=\"Go to Stryker Twiiter home page\" href=\"https://twitter.com/Stryker_AC\" target=\"_blank\">Twitter</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><a title=\"Go to Stryker LinkedIn page\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/showcase/stryker-acute-care/\" target=\"_blank\">LinkedIn</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Know a caregiver who truly goes above and beyond?</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/acute-care/c/caregiver-stories.html\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Nominate a hero</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n",
